WEBVTT

00:09.550 --> 00:13.880
EPISODE 2

00:13.970 --> 00:16.680
Foolish Brother. Ever the imbecile.

00:17.430 --> 00:21.810
The day has come when you
might actually prove of some use.

00:21.890 --> 00:23.100
Listen here, asshole--

00:24.560 --> 00:26.610
What the hell
are you three planning to do?

00:26.690 --> 00:27.690
Planning?

00:27.770 --> 00:31.240
Feels more like it's already on.

00:32.610 --> 00:35.240
Tell me this isn't real!

00:38.030 --> 00:40.540
A coronation for the new king?

00:40.620 --> 00:43.000
Wow! This suspense is killing me!

00:43.080 --> 00:46.080
I hear we're gettin' our asses blasted
so we come together as one.

00:46.170 --> 00:49.210
Like, all the gods from Heaven
are legit assembling!

00:49.300 --> 00:50.670
So cool!

00:51.300 --> 00:54.510
O mighty gods of all the realms above!

00:54.590 --> 00:59.260
I thank you for gathering here,
all for me.

00:59.350 --> 01:02.060
-Booyah!
-You da God!

01:02.140 --> 01:05.390
I, Ramie, your new King,
hereby declare the following.

01:05.480 --> 01:08.610
To preserve the fractured
order of this fallen Heaven,

01:08.690 --> 01:11.440
I shall unite the gods as one.

01:12.990 --> 01:16.570
Praise be! Praise be! Praise be!
Praise be!

01:16.660 --> 01:20.280
And now, without further ado,

01:21.410 --> 01:24.250
consider these your final moments.

01:25.620 --> 01:26.710
Huh?

01:29.500 --> 01:31.670
-He's sealing them in something.
-What's that smoke?

01:32.550 --> 01:34.970
They're stoned! And not in the good way!

01:35.510 --> 01:38.140
What's the deal
with turning gods into fucking rocks?

01:38.220 --> 01:39.890
Just watch and learn.

01:39.970 --> 01:43.970
<i>O leaderless flock,
with no shepherd to follow.</i>

01:44.600 --> 01:46.640
<i>O fallen gods, drunk on liberty.</i>

01:46.730 --> 01:50.400
<i>You who have reduced Heaven
to a decaying pit of sloth and chaos.</i>

01:50.480 --> 01:52.610
<i>Judgment Day is upon ye!</i>

01:56.860 --> 01:59.490
<i>All liberties are hereby rescinded</i>

02:00.200 --> 02:02.370
<i>to make way for a new purpose.</i>

02:02.450 --> 02:05.160
<i>Let thy flesh be sealed in stone</i>

02:05.250 --> 02:08.460
<i>then ground to ashes and refined</i>

02:08.540 --> 02:13.420
<i>to be cast anew as the greatest
explosive power known to godkind!</i>

02:13.500 --> 02:14.760
<i>Be delivered!</i>

02:15.300 --> 02:16.300
By God…

02:16.380 --> 02:21.640
The Forbidden Ancient Heavenly Weapon,
forged from the life force of the gods.

02:21.720 --> 02:24.140
It's God Bless You!

02:24.220 --> 02:27.100
-God…
-Bless You?

02:27.180 --> 02:31.400
Indeed. As your new King,
I have unified the gods.

02:31.480 --> 02:35.820
Now, to rejoice in the Heavenly Weapon,
born from the essence of the gods.

02:35.900 --> 02:38.110
A grand celebration, conceived by me,
blessed by me, for me alone.

02:38.200 --> 02:39.700
And it shall be called…

02:41.200 --> 02:43.080
God Festival!

02:43.870 --> 02:46.120
A.K.A… God Fes!

02:48.370 --> 02:52.670
But alas,
God Fes must come to an abrupt end.

02:52.750 --> 02:57.130
To the daughters of Linière, my brother,
the one who drowned Heaven in debauchery,

02:57.210 --> 03:00.090
trust that your moment
of reckoning is nigh.

03:00.180 --> 03:02.970
For you are about to bear witness…

03:05.680 --> 03:07.730
Behold! Your worst nightmares!

03:08.810 --> 03:12.350
My Heavenly Weapon of the gods!

03:12.440 --> 03:15.860
So freaking lit! Whoo!

03:15.940 --> 03:19.570
Flex it!
The Heavenly Weapon is totally bussin'!

03:20.240 --> 03:22.070
Lame as hell! The hell is this crap?

03:22.160 --> 03:25.870
That shit is nasty. And this is supposed
to be your Heavenly Weapon?

03:25.950 --> 03:28.250
Hey, Ramie. He's got the same mug as you.

03:29.040 --> 03:32.880
It seems the denizens of Heaven
all share the most vulgar of tastes.

03:32.960 --> 03:35.040
My eyes are begging me for mercy.

03:35.130 --> 03:36.800
This is crazy, like actually crazy!

03:36.880 --> 03:39.630
God's on another level!
Woo! Woo!

03:39.720 --> 03:42.720
What a buzzkill!
Old dude acting hype? Can't!

03:43.340 --> 03:46.810
Not gonna lie, that's mad annoying.
Please stop.

03:46.890 --> 03:47.890
Woo…

03:47.970 --> 03:51.770
And these demons are ruining the vibes
and sending God Fes into its flop era.

03:51.850 --> 03:55.690
King Ramie, heavenly unlawful entry
is, like, totally a crime.

03:55.770 --> 03:58.690
That means we gotta kill 'em, right?

03:58.780 --> 04:00.360
-Scanty!
-Kneesocks!

04:00.440 --> 04:01.450
Hold on a moment!

04:01.530 --> 04:05.530
As a dedicated servant of God,
I came prepared for this very occasion.

04:05.620 --> 04:07.490
My Lord! I have gifts for you.

04:08.620 --> 04:11.710
These babies are guaranteed to get any
god or angel packing to the great beyond!

04:11.790 --> 04:14.000
You'll see every one of these is divine.
Please, accept--

04:14.080 --> 04:16.090
How dare you bring such filth into Heaven!

04:16.170 --> 04:17.590
Oh, my God!

04:17.670 --> 04:19.090
Enough.

04:20.920 --> 04:22.760
You want us? Here we fucking are.

04:22.840 --> 04:25.340
This shit's going down on our turf,
so leave them out of it.

04:25.430 --> 04:28.720
If y'all motherfuckers want blood,
come and take it from us.

04:29.560 --> 04:31.850
-Panty…
-Stocking…

04:32.770 --> 04:33.770
You two…

04:38.690 --> 04:41.360
What is this? Our brainless little
angels trying to strike a pose?

04:41.440 --> 04:42.440
Huh?

04:42.530 --> 04:44.320
"Leave them out of it."

04:44.410 --> 04:46.450
"If you want blood, come
and take it from us."

04:46.530 --> 04:50.040
Such a pitiful display of
secondhand embarrassment.

04:50.120 --> 04:53.040
Zip it, you fuckin' demon!
I ain't trying to impress anyone!

04:53.120 --> 04:57.630
You're in no position to be acting tough.
We're actually trying to save your asses!

04:57.710 --> 05:00.750
Under what misguided notion makes you
think we require saving at your hands?

05:00.840 --> 05:03.720
-Shut up, you cretinous hag!
-Quiet, you plain Jane.

05:03.800 --> 05:04.970
You want some? Huh?

05:05.050 --> 05:07.720
-Bring it, bitch!
-Go to hell, bitch!

05:07.800 --> 05:09.350
Girls! Stop fighting!

05:09.430 --> 05:11.970
These guys really slept on the assignment.

05:12.060 --> 05:14.560
Fucking basic bitches!

05:15.980 --> 05:16.980
Damn skanks!

05:22.860 --> 05:25.610
Oh, no!

05:28.410 --> 05:30.830
-Oops.
-Now we've done it.

05:30.910 --> 05:33.830
Bruh! The demons and the human
literally just ghosted us for real!

05:33.910 --> 05:36.120
King Ramie! Permission to chase?

05:36.210 --> 05:38.040
There will be no need.

05:38.130 --> 05:39.130
-But my Lord!
-But my Lord!

05:39.210 --> 05:42.710
The living mortal will go back to Earth,

05:42.800 --> 05:44.920
and the demons will return to Hell.

05:45.010 --> 05:46.300
Isn't that right?

05:47.180 --> 05:50.600
Now that I have the Heavenly Weapon,

05:50.680 --> 05:52.810
the power to destroy Earth and Hell
is within my grasp.

05:52.890 --> 05:55.350
Both mortals and demons alike
are doomed to meet their end.

05:55.430 --> 05:56.730
You're so smart, your Highness!

05:57.350 --> 05:59.650
The fuck you up to this time?

06:01.650 --> 06:03.940
Like father, like daughter.

06:04.030 --> 06:06.110
Quite the slippery fingers you have.

06:11.160 --> 06:12.200
-The hell?
-The hell?

06:12.280 --> 06:15.250
I've received reports from my sons.

06:15.330 --> 06:19.960
You were living under the same roof
as those wretches, weren't you?

06:20.040 --> 06:23.170
Cohabiting with filthy demons.

06:23.250 --> 06:29.050
Such character falls short of the dignity
required to be first and second in line.

06:29.130 --> 06:34.680
You have no idea how many nights
I've wept over the future of the heavens.

06:34.770 --> 06:38.350
While foolish gods like my brother

06:38.440 --> 06:40.940
are praised and exalted for doing nothing!

06:41.020 --> 06:44.980
But now, with the gods unified as one,
it is time to reset this wretched plain.

06:45.070 --> 06:46.360
-Heaven will now be…
-Your Highness?

06:46.440 --> 06:49.860
Newly opened!

06:52.910 --> 06:55.950
I can't stand any more
of this father-son shit show.

06:56.040 --> 06:58.660
I couldn't care less about
your pathetic ambitions.

06:58.750 --> 07:02.080
But we're angels, not gods,
so why turn us into stones?

07:02.840 --> 07:05.050
Sounds like someone's
raggin' on his Highness.

07:05.130 --> 07:07.800
Hell nah. We ain't taking that shit
without some serious clap back!

07:07.880 --> 07:09.760
Stand down, my sons.

07:09.840 --> 07:14.600
My doltish nieces
still have their part to play in all this.

07:15.260 --> 07:19.230
I must have them witness everything
from the best seats in the house.

07:19.310 --> 07:25.820
That's right! Front-row warhead seats
to witness the world's downfall.

07:25.900 --> 07:31.030
Your Highness. I think the Heavenly Weapon
is locked and loaded and ready to fire.

07:31.110 --> 07:33.490
Excellent. In that case,

07:34.120 --> 07:38.290
consider this a little preview
before the main event.

07:39.000 --> 07:41.580
Prepare the Heavenly Catapult.

07:41.670 --> 07:43.880
-What is that?
-A big slide?

07:44.710 --> 07:46.380
Oh, my God!

07:46.460 --> 07:48.460
UFO is coming!

07:50.630 --> 07:54.260
This is but a mere drop
of the sheer power that is the gods.

07:54.340 --> 07:56.470
With this, I do declare…

07:56.560 --> 07:58.890
We are now at war with Hell.

08:11.610 --> 08:14.160
I know this place!
This is the Dark Arms Dealer, Gunsmith--

08:14.240 --> 08:19.910
Got it. Down the hatch, vitals stop,
and 24 hours to get in and out of Heaven.

08:20.000 --> 08:21.290
Bottoms up!

08:22.080 --> 08:25.460
Y'know, it's not like just anyone
can waltz right into Heaven.

08:30.710 --> 08:31.800
Panty! Stocking!

08:32.880 --> 08:34.800
-Where am I?
-Whatever do you mean?

08:34.890 --> 08:37.760
You two have been slacking
on gathering those Hell Coins.

08:37.850 --> 08:40.220
As such, your entry ban has been extended.

08:40.310 --> 08:42.310
Hell Coins? That's right, we were
supposed to gather those.

08:42.390 --> 08:44.390
Surely 60% should be sufficient?

08:44.480 --> 08:45.770
Scanty, Kneesocks…

08:45.850 --> 08:47.980
-Oh, hello, Garter.
-Where are we?

08:48.070 --> 08:50.030
We're at Hell's Border.

08:50.110 --> 08:51.940
Holy Hell! I'm in Hell?

08:52.030 --> 08:55.030
That goddamn harlot of a gunsmith.
She did me dirty!

08:55.110 --> 09:00.040
-You'll not get away with turning us away!
-Change of plans. Back to Earth for me.

09:00.830 --> 09:05.040
Oh, hell naw! I forgot to ask
how I even make my way back to Earth!

09:05.120 --> 09:08.500
How am I gonna get back to Earth,
let alone back into Heaven?

09:08.590 --> 09:10.750
Why on earth would you
want to go back there?

09:10.840 --> 09:12.260
After the way they treated you?

09:12.340 --> 09:15.630
<i>Ramie's used the gods
to create his Heavenly Weapon.</i>

09:15.720 --> 09:19.260
<i>If memory serves right,
that thing holds unimaginable power.</i>

09:19.350 --> 09:22.930
<i>It's got the power to destroy
not just Earth, but Hell as well.</i>

09:23.020 --> 09:25.390
<i>A goddamn weapon that should
never see the light of day!</i>

09:25.480 --> 09:27.060
Scanty, Kneesocks.

09:27.150 --> 09:30.570
You must come with me to Heaven
and help me save Panty and Stocking.

09:30.650 --> 09:32.990
-Excuse me?
-And why exactly should we be bothered?

09:33.070 --> 09:36.740
This mere mortal here?
I'm hopeless on my own!

09:36.820 --> 09:38.910
We're gonna need your
demon power on the squad too.

09:38.990 --> 09:42.910
You think we give two hoots about
what happens to those asinine twerps?

09:43.000 --> 09:44.540
Dear Sister is right--

09:44.620 --> 09:48.040
We lived together.
We broke bread with you.

09:48.130 --> 09:49.420
Does that count for nothing?

09:50.170 --> 09:52.380
Remember all the times you spent together.

09:52.460 --> 09:55.550
-<i>So basically, you're freeloaders.</i>
-<i>Freeloaders? Lame.</i>

09:55.630 --> 09:58.470
-<i>Get your shit together, housemaid.</i>
-<i>You, fucking demon four eyes.</i>

09:59.550 --> 10:02.560
Those fucking bitches!

10:03.180 --> 10:04.390
Dear Sister!

10:04.470 --> 10:06.640
Let's go, Kneesocks.

10:06.730 --> 10:09.100
So we're all going to Heaven?

10:09.190 --> 10:13.940
We are. Gotta knock some sense into those
shrews before we kill them ourselves.

10:14.030 --> 10:16.360
Couldn't have said it
better myself, Dear Sister.

10:17.280 --> 10:18.990
What in hell is this?

10:19.070 --> 10:22.080
This can only be the work of the gods!

10:22.160 --> 10:24.950
We gotta head toward the light.
That's where Heaven is!

10:26.660 --> 10:30.630
Look, Chuck. That horrible border
looks so small from here.

10:30.710 --> 10:34.250
Who knew getting into Heaven
was as easy as just keeling over?

10:34.340 --> 10:35.340
Chuck, chuck.

10:35.420 --> 10:38.130
You're right. We can't relax just yet.

10:38.220 --> 10:41.680
We gotta find Panty and tell her
what that nasty Ramie's got in store.

10:41.760 --> 10:42.850
Chuck!

10:42.930 --> 10:44.310
<i>No gods! No gods!</i>

10:44.390 --> 10:46.810
No gods? What are you talking about?

10:46.890 --> 10:49.230
Whoa! Someone's coming!
What do we do? Hide!

10:49.310 --> 10:52.940
Sheesh! I am so amped with all this hype.

10:54.230 --> 10:55.900
What is that? Some stray cat?

10:55.980 --> 10:58.070
Bruh, come on. That's totally a dog.

10:58.610 --> 11:00.160
-Cutie!
-What a good boy!

11:00.240 --> 11:01.910
<i>No gods! No gods!</i>

11:01.990 --> 11:03.200
You good?

11:03.280 --> 11:06.870
-I always wanted a dog of my own.
-Bruh, me too!

11:06.950 --> 11:10.370
It is God Fes, after all.
Maybe his Highness will let us keep him?

11:10.460 --> 11:11.580
Bleurgh…

11:11.670 --> 11:13.590
Yep. You look like an Eros.

11:14.380 --> 11:15.800
Come on, Eros!

11:15.880 --> 11:18.510
Well, they haven't found me yet.

11:20.130 --> 11:22.140
Panty! Stocking!

11:22.220 --> 11:24.140
Whoa! They're pissed as hell
being turned into stone!

11:24.220 --> 11:25.760
And is that Ramie?

11:25.850 --> 11:29.140
I am in way over my head here!

11:29.230 --> 11:32.150
I'll remember this…

11:32.230 --> 11:35.520
Fucking old dudes and their God complexes…

11:35.610 --> 11:36.900
Don't forget,

11:37.820 --> 11:40.950
today is a day for celebration.

11:43.950 --> 11:48.910
EPISODE 3

11:49.000 --> 11:52.040
How much higher is it to Heaven?

11:52.120 --> 11:54.170
What Dear Sister said.

11:54.250 --> 11:55.840
Shut the hell up and climb, damn it!

11:58.210 --> 11:59.340
What is that?

12:01.300 --> 12:02.300
Is that…

12:03.180 --> 12:04.590
gunpowder?

12:04.680 --> 12:06.010
I know what that means.

12:06.100 --> 12:12.310
This is the legendary Heavenly Catapult,
the Heavenly Weapon's shooting mechanism!

12:12.390 --> 12:14.900
Lucifer's left nipple!
Holy Mother of Hell!

12:14.980 --> 12:16.900
Exquisite!

12:16.980 --> 12:20.150
What sheer power within a single grain
of fine powder of the gods!

12:20.240 --> 12:25.660
The Heavenly Weapon must be a billion…
No, ten billion times stronger!

12:25.740 --> 12:29.490
Your Highness. The Heavenly Weapon
is locked and loaded.

12:30.250 --> 12:33.580
Jesus Christ, is he tryna start a war?

12:33.670 --> 12:37.590
That shouldn't be enough
to awaken Father…

12:37.670 --> 12:39.840
We cannot let that titanic statue fall.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.170
We must hurry.

12:41.800 --> 12:43.050
Fas!

12:43.130 --> 12:45.260
-Fastener.
-Unleash everything you've got.

12:45.340 --> 12:46.340
Fas?

12:47.220 --> 12:48.220
Fastener!

12:51.730 --> 12:53.890
That's a nice double head you got there!

12:56.020 --> 12:58.190
What's wrong, angels?
Rock got your tongue?

12:58.270 --> 13:01.490
Let's get you nice and comfortable
in your front-row seats.

13:01.570 --> 13:03.700
-On it, your Highness!
-On it, your Highness!

13:05.950 --> 13:07.120
Eros?

13:08.070 --> 13:10.620
I'm here for Panty and Stocking!

13:10.700 --> 13:12.370
-What the helly?
-A human?

13:12.450 --> 13:15.960
I don't know what it is you're planning,
but whatever it is, you're wrong.

13:16.500 --> 13:17.630
No! Not the statues!

13:17.710 --> 13:19.380
Get back here, human!

13:22.460 --> 13:25.380
Listen up, Mr. Illegal Alien-Human!

13:25.470 --> 13:30.760
Hand the sisters over,
and no cap, we'll low-key just let you go.

13:31.310 --> 13:33.810
No! I'm here to protect them

13:33.890 --> 13:35.600
no matter what!

13:41.320 --> 13:43.490
-Garter?
-Old Man?

13:43.570 --> 13:45.950
Angel brothers.
You'd best turn tail and run.

13:46.990 --> 13:48.410
Are we supposed to be shook?

13:49.240 --> 13:51.870
Did I stutter, motherfucker?

13:51.950 --> 13:54.870
Rise! Demon Sisters!

13:55.330 --> 13:57.870
Trust a holy man to forget his station
around demons.

13:57.960 --> 13:59.580
Demons!

14:02.420 --> 14:06.800
We fight
those filthy angel sisters every day!

14:07.510 --> 14:11.100
There's no way some snot-nosed brat
is going to best us!

14:14.020 --> 14:15.390
-That's it.
-It's kill time.

14:19.440 --> 14:20.980
Chuck.

14:21.980 --> 14:23.400
Fas?

14:27.200 --> 14:29.740
Fas, fas!

14:30.660 --> 14:32.120
Fas, chuck!

14:37.660 --> 14:39.420
Pure ecstasy!

14:46.260 --> 14:47.840
-Dear Sister!
-They're sprayin' nonstop.

14:49.180 --> 14:50.720
-Geek Boy!
-Chuck!

14:50.800 --> 14:53.600
Don't worry about me… I'm fine…

14:56.020 --> 14:57.770
Enough.

14:57.850 --> 15:00.150
I'll end this myself.

15:04.110 --> 15:08.740
You may be tolerant to heavenly weapons,
but a human can only withstand so much.

15:08.820 --> 15:12.950
With enough bullets, sooner or later
I'll have broken every bone in your body.

15:13.580 --> 15:14.950
Embrace oblivion.

15:15.040 --> 15:19.040
Yes. You're right. I am only human.

15:19.120 --> 15:21.460
But unfortunately for you, I'm a geek.

15:21.540 --> 15:22.580
So?

15:22.670 --> 15:24.420
And you know what they say about geeks?

15:24.500 --> 15:28.260
We're way tougher than you think!

15:28.340 --> 15:30.510
I may be just a geek boy,

15:30.590 --> 15:33.180
but as long as there's still breath in me,

15:33.260 --> 15:36.010
you will not touch Panty or Stocking

15:36.100 --> 15:40.270
because I, Geek Boy, will not allow it!

15:40.350 --> 15:42.770
Mere mortal,

15:42.850 --> 15:44.690
you dare defy a God?

15:46.610 --> 15:48.400
<i>Well said, Brief.</i>

15:52.070 --> 15:53.490
What's happening?

15:53.570 --> 15:55.660
Polyester! Polyurethane!

15:55.740 --> 15:59.700
It's time to put an end to this angel duo.

15:59.790 --> 16:01.540
Let's do this, Polyurethane!

16:01.620 --> 16:03.040
Bet!

16:03.540 --> 16:06.460
It's giving total climax vibes!

16:32.950 --> 16:34.450
Panty!

16:35.370 --> 16:36.700
Impossible!

16:36.780 --> 16:40.370
You're angels! Why didn't
my Heavenly Weapon work on you?

16:40.450 --> 16:42.080
It all makes sense!

16:42.580 --> 16:45.540
Panty and Stocking
are neither angels from Heaven,

16:45.630 --> 16:47.590
nor angels fallen to the Earth.

16:49.300 --> 16:53.760
They have touched death and been born
anew upon the very soil of the Earth!

16:55.970 --> 16:58.470
They are New Panty and Stocking!

16:59.180 --> 17:01.020
Fucking discount deity.

17:01.100 --> 17:03.640
Keep your grubby hands off our family.

17:03.730 --> 17:05.810
Family? You?

17:05.900 --> 17:09.650
Angels cohabiting with vile hellspawn
and guttersnipe humans?

17:10.730 --> 17:12.610
You deign to call us vile?

17:12.690 --> 17:14.780
Such a remark cannot go unpunished.

17:16.200 --> 17:18.120
Do not make me laugh!

17:19.200 --> 17:20.740
Behold!

17:24.460 --> 17:28.880
The power of true lineage!

17:32.170 --> 17:34.670
I, the new King of Gods,

17:34.760 --> 17:38.090
and my sons, first and second in line,

17:38.180 --> 17:43.060
by our powers combined,
we are the Holy Trinity!

17:43.140 --> 17:47.770
Authentic blood and bond!
A family of gods!

17:48.690 --> 17:50.110
Like hell I'm gonna let you!

17:54.860 --> 17:55.860
It's a revelation!

17:55.950 --> 17:58.280
-Whoever pulls the lever…
-Gets to be the winner.

17:58.360 --> 17:59.820
-A fine deduction.
-Your Highness!

17:59.910 --> 18:01.410
Call me Father.

18:01.490 --> 18:03.540
We are kin of the highest order.

18:03.620 --> 18:04.830
Father!

18:04.910 --> 18:07.500
Father! Permission to annihilate?

18:07.580 --> 18:10.130
-Permission granted.
-Thank you, Father!

18:11.540 --> 18:17.380
No house built on rot can hope to triumph
over one bound by virtue.

18:21.680 --> 18:23.260
What's the matter?

18:23.350 --> 18:26.640
Is that all your little family's got?

18:26.730 --> 18:28.650
The sooner you realize, the better.

18:28.730 --> 18:31.730
What you are up against
is sovereign strength!

18:31.820 --> 18:33.820
Uh-oh, we're in trouble…

18:33.900 --> 18:35.490
Not now…

18:35.570 --> 18:38.240
What are y'all pissin' yourselves for?

18:38.320 --> 18:41.370
I thought we were gonna spend
New Year's at Lingerie Land together?

18:41.450 --> 18:43.370
We got family tickets and everything!

18:43.450 --> 18:46.080
-That's right!
-We're going as a family.

18:46.160 --> 18:47.830
For New Year's!

18:48.620 --> 18:50.630
For Lingerie Land!

18:51.330 --> 18:52.380
Combine!

18:52.460 --> 18:55.460
Fas, chuck!

18:55.550 --> 18:57.920
-Holy shit!
-No fucking way!

18:58.510 --> 19:00.260
Smash!

19:02.970 --> 19:04.430
Impossible!

19:05.680 --> 19:09.100
Not only do you follow different creeds,
you are not even of the same species.

19:09.190 --> 19:11.650
Angels? Demons? Humans?

19:11.730 --> 19:15.570
Why, you're just a mishmash
of unrelated trash!

19:15.650 --> 19:18.950
Is that all you can preach?
Jesus, dude, you make me wanna puke!

19:19.030 --> 19:21.030
Family comes in all types
of different flavors.

19:21.110 --> 19:22.280
And ours?

19:22.370 --> 19:25.120
We welcome angels, demons,
humans, and all sorts to our club.

19:25.200 --> 19:29.120
Alive or dead? It don't matter to us.
We'll all join hands and sing "Kumbaya."

19:29.830 --> 19:31.420
And you wanna know why?

19:32.000 --> 19:34.210
'Cause we're bitches!

19:36.840 --> 19:38.630
Man, it feels good to be a bitch!

19:38.720 --> 19:42.010
Dirt-cheap deals, fam-only steals,
and VIP bitch swag stacked just for us!

19:42.090 --> 19:45.220
And with big year-end blowouts,
it's like you pay nothin' at all!

19:45.310 --> 19:48.930
What a steal! What a bitch!

19:49.020 --> 19:50.390
Whatever do you mean?

19:50.480 --> 19:52.100
The "F" in "Fuck"

19:52.190 --> 19:54.400
stands for "Family."

19:55.110 --> 19:58.400
Get 'em, girls! Panty and Stocking!

19:59.860 --> 20:02.320
And Scanty and Kneesocks!

20:03.490 --> 20:05.240
With Garterbelt!

20:06.450 --> 20:10.250
Featuring Geek Boy and Chuck and Fastener!

20:11.830 --> 20:15.460
Armed Fuck Gun!

20:22.760 --> 20:26.930
An illegal gun that turns
everything to white powder?

20:27.010 --> 20:30.060
But the Fucking Family is too late.

20:30.140 --> 20:32.520
I have the Heavenly Weapon right here.

20:32.600 --> 20:36.020
While you were showing off,
I've been readying it to blow!

20:36.110 --> 20:37.270
There's no stopping it now!

20:37.360 --> 20:39.650
-Soon it will be the end!
-Wow, cheeky.

20:39.730 --> 20:41.490
-Seriously?
-No more Heaven, Earth, or Hell!

20:41.570 --> 20:44.530
I will reign as God supreme!

20:44.610 --> 20:45.950
Are you even listening?

20:47.780 --> 20:49.160
Well, now what?

20:49.240 --> 20:50.500
Isn't it obvious?

20:50.580 --> 20:52.710
We break that motherfucker up into pieces.

20:52.790 --> 20:54.120
I thought as much.

20:54.210 --> 20:57.040
The Fuck Bullets in this Fuck Gun
are full of impurities,

20:57.130 --> 20:59.750
so if we punch a hole
through to the middle of the statue,

20:59.840 --> 21:02.510
it should return to its god-powder state.

21:02.590 --> 21:06.220
So basically we blast his ass
and it's happy endings for all?

21:06.300 --> 21:09.010
That's the worst way to put it,
but it's basically right.

21:09.100 --> 21:11.220
Whoa! UFO is return!

21:12.100 --> 21:14.520
O, evil spirit born of those lost…

21:14.600 --> 21:16.770
…between heaven and earth.

21:16.850 --> 21:18.900
May the thunder from the garments…

21:18.980 --> 21:21.280
…of these holy, tender-skinned maidens…

21:21.360 --> 21:23.780
…shatter your foulness, impurity,
and stagnation into pieces…

21:23.860 --> 21:26.450
…and return you to heaven and earth.

21:27.120 --> 21:29.240
Repent!

21:30.160 --> 21:32.290
Stupid angels! Stop!

21:32.870 --> 21:39.750
Fuck You Bitch!

21:58.980 --> 22:01.360
Oh, yeah! I am Super Guy "Jin"!

22:03.320 --> 22:06.070
-What happened?
-Is this Earth?

22:06.150 --> 22:07.820
Ugh, I'm going home.

22:07.910 --> 22:09.820
Yep. Time to knock on Heaven's door.

22:11.200 --> 22:14.790
<i>And so, the shadow passed.
Hell and Earth were safe from harm.</i>

22:14.870 --> 22:17.420
<i>And Heaven knew peace once more.</i>

22:18.080 --> 22:21.590
<i>And as for Panty and Stocking's parents,</i>

22:21.670 --> 22:23.840
<i>through sheer luck and false pretenses,</i>

22:23.920 --> 22:26.260
<i>they managed to fudge
their way back into power.</i>

22:26.340 --> 22:28.590
You let Ramie off the hook?

22:28.680 --> 22:32.560
Yeah. He just worked himself
a little too hard.

22:33.430 --> 22:37.020
Ramie just needs a little quality time
to spend with his family.

22:40.480 --> 22:41.770
<i>And as for me,</i>

22:42.520 --> 22:43.730
<i>as of today,</i>

22:43.820 --> 22:45.940
<i>I'm going to profess my love for Panty.</i>

22:46.030 --> 22:50.160
<i>Right here, on New Year's,
here at Lingerie Land!</i>

22:50.820 --> 22:53.740
Hey, Geek Boy. You're telling Panty
you like her tonight, yeah?

22:53.830 --> 22:56.580
Geek Boy has a thing for the raging slut?
Well, congratulations.

22:56.660 --> 22:59.170
Wishing you all the best, Geek Boy.

22:59.250 --> 23:00.960
We're all rooting for you.

23:01.630 --> 23:03.630
<i>Thanks guys. I appreciate it.</i>

23:04.550 --> 23:08.260
Wow, would you look at that!
Daten City looks huge from up here.

23:10.340 --> 23:11.720
Huh? Why'd we stop?

23:11.800 --> 23:14.350
Jesus Christ! I'm too nervous
to even open my mouth!

23:14.430 --> 23:16.140
And they're all waiting for me!

23:16.220 --> 23:18.600
Do it! Just fucking do it, Brief!

23:18.680 --> 23:19.690
Panty.

23:35.740 --> 23:37.620
-You get 'em, tiger!
-Way to go!

23:38.700 --> 23:39.870
Happy New Year.

23:39.960 --> 23:43.130
<i>Daten City, a town clinging
to the threshold between Heaven and Hell.</i>

23:43.210 --> 23:45.380
<i>And yet there are souls who,
without acclaim,</i>

23:45.460 --> 23:48.550
<i>tend to the love born
of every living soul.</i>

23:49.470 --> 23:53.010
<i>Their names are Panty and Stocking.</i>

23:53.090 --> 23:57.350
<i>It bears repeating, so I'll say it again.
Their names are Panty and Stocking!</i>

23:57.430 --> 24:01.640
<i>Panty and Stocking!</i>

24:06.820 --> 24:08.650
Oh, my, oh, my…

24:12.490 --> 24:13.780
Is that…

24:13.870 --> 24:15.070
-Father?
-Father?

24:16.580 --> 24:18.120
Panty!

24:20.200 --> 24:21.250
Whoa…

24:40.140 --> 24:41.600
Good morning.

24:42.310 --> 24:44.400
Junior and Bastard.

24:44.480 --> 24:45.980
Sup, chat?

24:46.060 --> 24:47.980
Sister Stockiel to you!

24:48.070 --> 24:49.070
Hey, Granny Gothcore.

24:49.150 --> 24:51.570
I told you, it's Sister Stockiel!

24:51.650 --> 24:53.780
Now tell me, children.
For what reason were you born?

24:53.860 --> 24:57.410
To find Mommy and Daddy
who went off to get milk!

24:57.490 --> 24:58.870
Facts.

24:58.950 --> 25:00.580
Chuck.

25:01.540 --> 25:05.040
How wonderful!
Another holy mandate from Heaven.

25:05.120 --> 25:07.670
Now, go forth!

25:07.750 --> 25:09.750
Subtitle: Rychelle Brittain
